{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在人物动机的解释和整体叙事收束上不如X完整，尤其X最后明确交代了即使未来没有人再给予亲近，他也愿意独自好好生活。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更适合边听边扫：加亮的关键词能迅速抓住每段心理变化的落点，感受词按音乐小节出现，又让人能够把听到的声音变化和人物感受及时对应起来，细节明显比X丰富、具体。X的优势是把人物为什么犹豫、为什么想回去又不愿回去交代得更充分，最后的心理选择也更完整；但Y并没有丢掉主要故事线，因此综合实际观看体验，我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "89ea352e-f307-434f-9b19-2d582e2a0e1c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T073351809135Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.984, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:34:56.801565+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "766b08d32b0900a9f50fb4ec3e31734d71d3bf53dbe9f3bf063d0cdadd811e82", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf